    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated just five minutes to Tulla village and equal distance to O'Callaghan's Mills is this outstanding and immaculately presented and extended traditional cottage boasting all the modern luxuries while enjoying immense character set on a spectacular landscaped private site with yard and a host of outbuildings. The main home features three/four bedrooms, main reception flowing into open plan kitchen/dining with modern fitted kitchen, solid fuel stove, built in units to all bedrooms, extensive quality tiling and timber floors throughout to mention just some of the many internal features. Outside the gated concrete yard leads to a host of outbuildings offering outstanding potential for the prospective buyer. In addition is a small gated paddock which adjoins the main house. Double fronted access and outstanding location this would make the ideal family home with viewings highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agents. PSL 002295"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.53m x 1m\nQuality tiled flooring, glass panel connecting door to main reception, door leading to bedroom one/reception two and telephone point.\n\nReception Room One - 4.43m x 3m\nQuality tiled flooring, built in eye level wall units with glazed display, integrated drawers and ample overhead storage, feature fireplace with integrated solid fuel stove with polished flag, double doors to hotpress housing immersion tank and shelving. Door to main hallway, door to bedroom two and open arch to kitchen/dining.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 4.3m x 3.9m\nModern oak style built in wall and base units with ample work surfaces, single drainer sink with mixer tap, space and plumbing for electrical appliances, tiled splashback surround and open plan to dining with additional built in storage units and connecting door to utility.\n\nReception Two/Bedroom One - 4.35m x 2.82m\nMaple style timber flooring, built in wall mounted eye level display units with glazed doors, integrated mirror with overhead storage with exposed shelving, tv unit with ample surfaces and double press base, tiled surround feature fireplace and access to additional attic storage.\n\nUtility Room - 3.55m x 1.83m\nBuilt in base units with ample work surfaces, space and plumbing for washing machine and dryer, wall mounted coat rail, access to additional attic storage and connecting door to shower room (also acting as ensuite off bedroom four).\n\nBedroom Two - 3m x 2.45m\nSemi solid maple flooring, wall to wall and ceiling to floor built in wardrobes with ample hanging rails with additional overhead and base storage and integrated shelving with indentation for double or single bed with matching bedside locker.\n\nMain Hallway - 5.17m x 1m\nConnecting doors to bedrooms three and four.\n\nBedroom Three - 3.6m x 3.5m\nOak style timber flooring and built in wardrobes with ample hanging rails and additional overhead and base storage.\n\nBedroom Four - 3.9m x 3.43m\nOak style timber flooring and built in wardrobes with ample hanging rails and additional overhead and base storage.\n\nEnsuite - 3.35m x 2.15m\nLow level WC, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror unit, wet room style shower tray with overhead electric shower, built in vanity unit with double press base and quality wall and floor tiling.\n\nOutbuilding One - 12m x 4.55m\n4.5m opening sliding door with separate pedestrian door.\n\nOutbuilding Two - 3.95m x 3.73m\n\n\nOutbuilding Three - 3.95m x 3.8m\n\n\nOutbuilding Four - 3.95m x 3.45m\n\n\nOutbuilding Five - 3m x 1.82m\n\n\nOutbuilding Six - 9m x 3.53m\n\n\nOpen Shed - 6.37m x 3.8m\nIn addition to this are a number of fuel storage lean-tos.\n\n"
      },
      {
